---
source: crates/rdra-ish-emit/src/tla/tests.rs
expression: "bundle.witness_cfg.expect(\"a witness cfg\")"
---
\* Each Witness_<E>_<col>_<s> says no instance is ever at s, so TLC reports it violated
\* where s is reached: a healthy model violates every one. A Witness_ TLC does not
\* report is a state with no witness.
\* With -continue TLC reports one invariant per state, the first here: rerun
\* without the reported ones until a run reports no new one.
SPECIFICATION Spec
INVARIANT TypeOK
INVARIANT Witness_Order_status_pending
INVARIANT Witness_Order_status_paid
INVARIANT Witness_Order_status_shipped
INVARIANT Witness_Order_status_refunded
CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
